&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP Media&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. With exceptional talent, trusted data and intelligence, and world-class partnerships – all united by our pioneering agentic marketing platform, WPP Open – we help clients navigate change, capture opportunity, and deliver transformational growth. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is WPP&#39;s AI-driven media operating unit, bringing together media, data, and partnerships to deliver creative personalisation at scale. Connected through WPP Open and powered by Open Intelligence, clients see exactly where, how, and why their media investment is working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;wppmedia.com&quot;&gt;wppmedia.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;3431 - Associate Director, Social - Manchester&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Summary and Impact&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Associate Director, Social, you will be a core strategic leader responsible for driving the commercial success, operational excellence, and overarching roadmaps for key clients. This role requires an elevated blend of senior paid social expertise, macro strategic vision, and deep commercial acumen. You will assume overarching strategic and commercial accountability for your portfolio, ensuring paid social strategies directly accelerate client business transformation and deliver high-impact commercial results.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will act as a trusted advisor to senior level stakeholders, navigating complex matrix environments and articulating the strategic value of paid social in the broader marketing mix. Leading a multi-tiered team of social managers and specialists, you will foster a culture of creative innovation, rigorous testing, and continuous professional growth. Furthermore, you will play a pivotal role in driving agency growth by supporting with new business pitches, developing Joint Business Plans (JBPs) with platform partners, and establishing yourself as an authoritative voice in the wider media industry.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Senior Associate Directors have several key areas of focus. These include:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Strategic Leadership &amp;amp; Innovation&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Formulate and execute macro-level paid social strategies aligned with broad client business outcomes (e.g., brand equity, customer lifetime value, market penetration).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Spearhead innovation across first-party data strategies, privacy-first media planning, conversion APIs (CAPI), and AI-driven social operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Champion cross-channel integration, collaborating closely with search, programmatic, strategy, and creative teams to deliver cohesive omni-channel campaigns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Commercial Management &amp;amp; Agency Growth&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain commercial oversight across your portfolio, driving organic account growth and ensuring client profitability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop paid social strategies for new business pitches and RFPs, delivering compelling proposals that win new client accounts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own joint business plans (JBPs) with platform partners (Meta, TikTok, Pinterest, Snap, LinkedIn, Reddit), securing priority alpha/beta testing access for clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Client &amp;amp; Executive Stakeholder Relations&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as a senior point of escalation and trusted partner for client and planning leads.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver high-impact presentations, translating complex technical data into clear, boardroom-ready commercial insights.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;People Management &amp;amp; Operational Excellence&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead, mentor, and build a high-performing team of social specialists, setting clear KPIs and development plans.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee team resourcing, capacity planning, and operational workflows to ensure high-quality, faultless campaign delivery across all accounts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish and govern agency best practice, QA frameworks, and compliance standards across all social channels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills and Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At WPP Media, we believe in the power of our culture and our people. It’s what elevates us to deliver exceptional experiences for both our clients and each other. In this role it will be critical to embrace WPP &amp;amp; WPP Media’s shared core values:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be &lt;strong&gt;Extraordinary&lt;/strong&gt; by &lt;em&gt;Leading Collectively&lt;/em&gt; to &lt;em&gt;Inspire transformational Creativity.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create an &lt;strong&gt;Open&lt;/strong&gt; environment by&lt;em&gt; Balancing People and Client Experiences&lt;/em&gt; by &lt;em&gt;Cultivating Trust&lt;/em&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead &lt;strong&gt;Optimistically&lt;/strong&gt; by &lt;em&gt;Championing Growth&lt;/em&gt; &lt;em&gt;and Development&lt;/em&gt; to &lt;em&gt;Mobilize the Enterprise&lt;/em&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Required Skills &amp;amp; Qualifications:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience &amp;amp; Track Record:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Proven track record of leading large-scale, enterprise or multi-market client portfolios within a media agency environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Senior Team Leadership:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Demonstrable success in leading multi-tiered teams, driving high team retention, talent development, and operational resource planning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Commercial &amp;amp; Pitch Capability:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Proven record of supporting new business and growing organic client revenue, with a strong understanding of agency commercial models.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Platform Mastery &amp;amp; JBPs:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;In-depth, expert-level knowledge of major advertising platforms (Meta Ads Manager, TikTok Ads Manager, Pinterest Ads Manager, Snap, LinkedIn) alongside experience managing platform partner relationships and JBPs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Advanced Measurement &amp;amp; Effectiveness:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Proven capability in implementing sophisticated measurement frameworks including incrementality / lift testing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Executive Communication &amp;amp; Influence:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Outstanding verbal, written, and pitch presentation skills, with the ability to articulate complex strategic narratives effortlessly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Portfolio Management:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Masterful organizational skills with the ability to balance competing strategic priorities, client accounts, and agency-wide initiatives seamlessly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Preferred Skills &amp;amp; Qualifications:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in paid social media.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Platform certifications (e.g., Meta Blueprint, TikTok Certifications).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Life at WPP Media &amp;amp; Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our passion for shaping the next era of media includes investing in our employees to help them do their best work, and we’re just as committed to employee growth as we are to responsible media investment. WPP Media employees can tap into the global WPP Media &amp;amp; WPP networks to pursue their passions, grow their networks, and learn at the cutting edge of marketing and advertising. We have a variety of employee resource groups and host frequent in-office events showcasing team wins, sharing thought leadership, and celebrating holidays and milestone events. Our benefits include competitive medical, group retirement plans, vision, and dental insurance, significant paid time off, preferential partner discounts, and employee mental health awareness days.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is an equal opportunity employer and considers applicants for all positions without discrimination or regard to particular characteristics. We are committed to fostering a culture of respect in which everyone feels they belong and has the same opportunities to progress in their careers.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We believe the best work happens when we&#39;re together, fostering creativity, collaboration, and connection. That&#39;s why we’ve adopted a hybrid approach, with teams in the office around four days a week. If you require accommodations or flexibility, please discuss this with the hiring team during the interview process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Please note this is a UK based role and requires individuals to have the right to work in this location&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please read our Privacy Notice (&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy&quot;&gt;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy)&lt;/a&gt; for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-Promoted&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;Please read our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy#:~:text=WPP%20Media%20Privacy%20Notice%20for%20Recruitment&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Burson, part of WPP, is the global communications leader built to create value for clients through reputation. With highly specialized teams, industry-leading technologies and breakthrough creative, we help brands and businesses redefine reputation as a competitive advantage so they can lead today and into the future. When you work at Burson, you are part of a global community of lifelong learners who thrive at the edge of innovation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP (LSE/NYSE: WPP) is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. We unite cutting-edge media intelligence and data solutions, world-class creativity, next-generation production, transformative enterprise solutions and expert strategic counsel in a single company – powered by exceptional talent and our agentic marketing platform, WPP Open, to help our clients navigate change, capture opportunity and deliver transformational growth. For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;WPP.com&quot;&gt;WPP.com&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information visit&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.bursonglobal.com/&quot;&gt;bursonglobal.com&lt;/a&gt; and follow us on &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/burson/posts/?feedView=all&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt; and&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/burson.global/?hl=en&quot;&gt;Instagram&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;More about the role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for an ambitious and commercially minded Director, Social&amp;nbsp;and Content to help shape and deliver Burson’s social offer in the UK.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a senior client and capability leadership role for someone who understands how social can build reputation, influence culture and drive meaningful business impact. Working as part of Burson’s Influence &amp;amp; Social capability, the Director will lead significant client relationships,&amp;nbsp; develop integrated social strategies, identify opportunities for organic and new business growth, and help raise the standard of social excellence across the agency.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The role will work closely with colleagues across Influence, Creative, Strategy, Insights &amp;amp; Intelligence and our four practices to bring together the right expertise around our clients.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The successful candidate will combine deep social expertise with strong client counsel and commercial instincts. They will be equally comfortable advising senior clients, shaping a sophisticated social strategy, leading a pitch, developing an idea with creatives and helping teams deliver brilliant work through content.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build strong relationships across Burson’s practices and act as a trusted senior adviser to clients on social strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead integrated social strategies and programmes that support reputation, brand, influence and wider business objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate client challenges into clear social strategies, channel approaches and creative opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Creative, Strategy, Influence, Insights &amp;amp; Intelligence, production and client teams to deliver integrated, social-first work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bring strong knowledge of platforms, audiences, creators, communities, culture and emerging behaviours into client counsel.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure social work is strategically strong, creatively ambitious, measurable and commercially effective.Identify and convert organic growth opportunities, and play a leading role in new business and pitch development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Champion social excellence across Burson, evolving the agency’s proposition and embedding the&amp;nbsp;Total Influence approach.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Explore how AI, emerging technology and stronger measurement can improve social strategy, insight, creativity and delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coach and develop the social team, share expertise across the agency, and help build Burson’s broader social capability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience that contributes to success:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Significant experience in a senior social role within a communications, PR, social, creative or integrated agency environment, leading integrated teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of social strategy, platforms, audiences, communities and cultural trends.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong knowledge of the major social platforms, particularly TikTok and Meta, alongside an understanding of the evolving creator and social technology ecosystem.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A proven ability to develop sophisticated social strategies that connect clearly to client and business objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong client leadership skills and experience advising senior stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A commercial mindset, with evidence of growing existing client relationships and contributing to successful new business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of social measurement and the ability to demonstrate the impact and value of social activity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Curiosity about AI and emerging technology and how they can transform social strategy and delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent presentation and storytelling skills, with the confidence to lead senior client conversations and pitches.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A collaborative leadership style and a genuine commitment to developing others.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Burson UK was named Cannes Lions Agency of the year 2026!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;#LI-CY1&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You belong at Burson:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our vision is for Burson to be the leading ‘academy company’ for creative communications professionals and emerging leaders. We provide a dynamic environment where ambitious colleagues come to elevate their skills, expand their networks, and ultimately, produce the best solutions for today’s leading brands. Our commitment to your growth is reflected in our robust benefits and people programs, which include professional development opportunities, mentorship programs with industry leaders, a vibrant and inclusive company culture fostering collaboration and innovation and packages designed to reward and retain top talent. We invest in our people because we believe their success is our success.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Burson, we’re an agency of learn-it-alls. We recognize that the things we do best, creativity and communications, require a level of nuanced understanding. That’s why it’s imperative for us to hire extraordinarily talented people of all backgrounds and identities. Without that we can’t do the essential work of inspiring bold ideas, fostering constructive dialogue, cultivating meaningful experiences, and driving innovation and creativity for our partners. Your unique point of view—your talent—is what makes you a #BursonPerson, and it’s how we deliver exceptional results for our clients, together.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe the best work happens when we&#39;re together, fostering creativity, collaboration, and connection. That&#39;s why we’ve adopted a hybrid approach, with teams in the office around four days a week. If you require accommodations or flexibility, please discuss this with the hiring team during the interview process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;When you click the &quot;Submit Application&quot; button below, this will send any information you add below to Burson. Before you do this, we think it&#39;s a good idea to read through our &amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.bursonglobal.com/p/recruitment-privacy-notice&quot;&gt;Recruitment Privacy Policy. &lt;/a&gt;California residents should read our  &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.bursonglobal.com/p/california-recruitment-privacy-notice&quot;&gt;California Recruitment Privacy Notice. &lt;/a&gt;This explains what we do with your personal data when you apply for a role with us, and, how you can update the information you have provided us with or how to remove it.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Meet Yubico&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Yubico is a global leader in identity security and creator of the YubiKey, the original hardware-backed passkey. We are publicly traded on Nasdaq Stockholm; our global footprint includes headquarters in Stockholm, Sweden, Silicon Valley, California; and Singapore.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Join Our Mission?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Yubico, we are guided by a shared belief that your work matters. We operate under a cultural philosophy of &lt;em&gt;Speed with Integrity&lt;/em&gt;, pushing the boundaries of technology to secure the AI frontier—protecting both human and agentic AI interactions—and leading the transition to post-quantum cryptography. In everything we do, we live by our core values:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Battle Friction:&lt;/strong&gt; We constantly look for new ways to simplify our products, our work, and the user experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Inspire Higher:&lt;/strong&gt; We think big, champion the open internet, and strive to do the right thing even when it is difficult.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;One Team:&lt;/strong&gt; We are open, responsive, and collaborative, overcoming challenges and celebrating our successes together.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Aligned with our commitment to open standards, we foster a thriving builder ecosystem through the&lt;a href=&quot;https://developers.yubico.com/&quot;&gt; Yubico Developer Program&lt;/a&gt;, offering free&lt;a href=&quot;https://developers.yubico.com/Software_Projects/&quot;&gt; open-source repositories&lt;/a&gt;, libraries, and SDKs to help developers rapidly integrate strong hardware authentication into any application. Through close collaborations with technical partners like Google, Microsoft, and Amazon, as well as newer frontiers like OpenAI, we continue to shape a safer digital world while donating security keys to protect vulnerable communities, journalists, and humanitarian groups worldwide through our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.yubico.com/why-yubico/secure-it-forward/&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Secure it Forward&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt; program.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;At Yubico, we offer:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Yubico Values: &lt;/strong&gt;We work to ensure that our employees have an open space to have their voices amplified to create a workplace where everyone feels like they belong. In support of this, our employees have created some pretty cool Employee Resource Groups that foster inclusion, help build community and connection across Yubico. Additionally, Yubico donates YubiKeys to organizations in need all over the world (you can read more about our work &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.yubico.com/why-yubico/secure-it-forward/&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Social Connection:&lt;/strong&gt; Relationships and connectedness matter, and we love spending time with our team! Our virtual workspace keeps us connected day-to-day whether it&#39;s through Yubico celebrating wins or our buzzing Slack communities. Check out our&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/yubico/life/17456342-be9b-4b35-b561-9ea3e892e9cc/&quot;&gt; Life at Yubico Page&lt;/a&gt; on LinkedIn and our awards&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.yubico.com/about/awards/&quot;&gt; here&lt;/a&gt;&lt;strong&gt;.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Yubico is looking for an experienced and highly collaborative Senior Product Manager to define the product vision, strategy, and roadmap for the Tools, Libraries, and Applications (TLA) that underlie many of Yubico products and services. In this role, you will be a technical leader in our product management team and work closely with builders across a variety of our products&amp;nbsp; from open source libraries and SDKs which empower other developers to create amazing things with our products, command line tools for managing and using YubiKeys and YubiHSMs, as well as graphical apps for mobile and desktop platforms.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our team works with authentication protocols like FIDO2/WebAuthn and uses cryptography to implement open standards. You&#39;ll have the opportunity to help us showcase our libraries in sample apps, making complex topics easier to use. You will help define and deliver the success of Yubico’s foundational product areas and expand the use of our technology to new and innovative areas that capture the market demand. You will serve as the strategic counterpart to our Senior Director of Engineering for Tools, Libraries &amp;amp; Apps.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role will own the &quot;what&quot; and &quot;why&quot; behind the enterprise-grade, secured, and reliable software used to build new applications and services that expand the value of Yubico hardware and services. To succeed, you will work closely with other product managers, engineers, solutions engineers, and operations teams to translate complex business and technical requirements into a robust definition for the foundational tools, libraries and applications in our expanding product portfolio&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tasks &amp;amp; Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product Strategy &amp;amp; Roadmap Ownership:&lt;/strong&gt; Define and execute the long-term product vision and roadmap for our foundational tools, libraries, and applications, ensuring tight alignment with overarching business goals and customer needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional Collaboration:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner deeply across Engineering, Product, Operations, and Security teams to design high-impact capabilities that enhance product foundations that underlie efficiency and scalability of our solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Customer focus&lt;/strong&gt;: Meet with customers to understand market demand and outcomes for new products&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements Definition:&lt;/strong&gt; Translate complex workflows and software requirements into clear, high-quality product requirement documents (PRDs) and user stories.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Partnership &amp;amp; Conflict Resolution:&lt;/strong&gt; Serve as the strategic unifier in cross-functional technical decisions. Actively synthesize competing priorities between product vision and architectural necessity, ensuring trade-offs are documented, data-backed, and optimized for long-term reliability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data-driven Insights&lt;/strong&gt;: Provide data-driven insights on the specific products being managed, including sales and financial performance, year-over-year trends, pipeline, etc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Full life cycle management: &lt;/strong&gt;Manage the full life-cycle of a product from inception to end of life including: conception, market and requirements gathering, customer validation, creation of high-quality requirements document, management of engineering, marketing preparation, release and end-of-life processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Security &amp;amp; Compliance Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Collaborate with security and engineering teams to ensure software systems seamlessly integrate with critical cryptographic infrastructure (such as PKI and HSMs) while maintaining Yubico&#39;s gold standard of security.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Basic Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Education:&lt;/strong&gt; Bachelor&#39;s Degree in Computer Science, Engineering, Business, or a related field (or equivalent experience).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; 10+ years of progressively broadening product management experience, with a strong track record of shipping complex, enterprise-class hardware &amp;amp; manufacturing solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Domain Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven experience in technical product management including development of large-scale internal tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Leadership &amp;amp; Acumen:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven ability to act as a constructive challenger to highly technical engineering partners. Strong business and technical acumen with the confidence to debate architectural tradeoffs and act as a constructive challenger in deeply technical environments and manage competing priorities across geographically distributed teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Communication:&lt;/strong&gt; Exceptional communication and stakeholder management skills to align multi-disciplinary teams toward a unified vision.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cryptographic Systems: &lt;/strong&gt;Understanding of cryptographic systems, Public Key Infrastructure (PKI), or Key Management Systems utilizing Hardware Security Modules (HSMs).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Analytical Mindset:&lt;/strong&gt; Excellent analytical and problem-solving skills with a hands-on approach to diving deep into technical workflows alongside engineering teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;U.S. benefits designed for your overall well-being:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Health coverage.&lt;/strong&gt; We’ve got you covered with top of the line health plans, including dental and vision. We pay 100% of your premium and 85% for your family.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Retirement plan.&lt;/strong&gt; Our retirement plan includes a 401K dollar per dollar match up to 6% with a cap of $6K/year. Immediate vesting.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Wellness reimbursement.&lt;/strong&gt; We offer $1,200.00 in wellness earnings (prorated based on start date) that you can use on your gym membership, a massage, or your favorite online fitness classes. This is a taxable benefit if you choose to participate.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Learning and development.&lt;/strong&gt; We encourage your professional growth and offer a yearly development stipend of $3,000 and mentorship program.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Time off.&lt;/strong&gt; We offer a total of 15 vacation days plus 10 holidays, and 7 sick days a year.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Paid parental leave.&lt;/strong&gt; We love welcoming new family members to our YubiTeam! All parents receive 8 weeks of paid leave. Birthing parents receive an additional 8 weeks of paid leave (16 weeks total).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Commuter Benefits.&lt;/strong&gt; If you need to commute to the office, we offer commuter benefits.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong mission &amp;amp; company values.&lt;/strong&gt; We’re a global team on a global mission to make the internet more secure for everyone. We believe that every person’s work matters. That you should always be nice, stay humble, and have fun, and never take yourself too seriously.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-BR1&lt;br&gt;#LI-Remote&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;Yubico offers a holistic Total Rewards package designed to support our employees in all aspects of their life inside and outside of work. This role has the annual salary range as defined below for a salary pay range for a candidate located in the San Francisco Bay Area. For roles that are filled in other locations, the compensation range will be based on data provided by the Radford McLagan Compensation Database from Aon. Final compensation is also based on a number of factors including, but not limited to, job-related knowledge, skills, and experience.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Salary Pay Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$175,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$210,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;We are an equal opportunity employer, we value diversity and uphold an inclusive environment where all people feel that they are equally respected and valued. All applicants will be considered for employment without attention to race, color, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, age, marital status, religion, national origin, disability, protected Veteran status or any other characteristic protected by law. We&#39;d love to learn about what you can add to our diverse team. We are an E-Verify Participating Employer.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Yubico does not accept agency resumes or referrals so please do not send them to our careers staff or employees. Yubico is not responsible for any fees related to unsolicited resumes or referrals.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Personal data submitted through this form is used for managing Yubico’s recruitment activities, which include facilitating any application you make, setting up and conducting interviews and tests for applicants, evaluating and assessing results and selecting candidates, and as otherwise needed in our recruitment and onboarding processes. The use of your personal data may also be necessary prior to entering into a contract with you (that is prior to offering you a job with Yubico). Your personal data will only be used for the purposes for which it was collected and in accordance with the &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.yubico.com/support/terms-conditions/privacy-notice/&quot;&gt;Yubico Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;. We only keep your personal data for as long as necessary and in compliance with Yubico’s record retention policies. If you have asked us to, we will keep you informed of other opportunities at Yubico. We do this in various ways, including email and by phone. If at any time you do not want us to contact you or use your information as described herein please contact us at ----- to let us know and we will delete all such information. Providing your personal data is voluntary, but necessary to join our talent community, and if you do not agree to provide your data, we will not be able to consider you as part of our talent community.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As part of providing the requested service, we will transfer your data to be processed by &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.greenhouse.com/privacy-policy-june-27-2024&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Greenhouse Software Inc.&lt;/a&gt;,&amp;nbsp;a service provider contracted by Yubico AB and/or its subsidiaries that meets legally mandated privacy requirements. The Yubico Privacy Notice offers more information about Yubico privacy practices, including the lawful basis for processing of personal data, how to lodge a complaint with the supervisory authority, and how to contact Yubico to exercise your data subject rights. In this notice, when we refer to &quot;Yubico&quot;, &quot;us&quot;, &quot;we&quot; or &quot;our&quot;, we mean the Yubico group company or companies that you apply to, or correspond with, and which are responsible for any personal data collected about you.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re the world&#39;s leading consumer healthcare platform, supporting millions of patients across the US, Australia, the UK, Germany, Japan, Spain and Canada.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re driven by the belief that good health should last a lifetime, and that to get there we need to deliver the personalised, high quality and empathetic care that the traditional system cannot support.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll partner with our care teams of prescribers, nurses, health coaches, pharmacists and dietitians to support patients across preventative health, weight management and specific women&#39;s and men&#39;s health conditions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We joined Hims &amp;amp; Hers so that you can do all of the above on a bigger scale, with more ambition, a stronger global brand and the resources to deliver care to patients in dozens of countries.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for people who appreciate and are excited by the enormity and uniqueness of this challenge, and want to work in the most ambitious, smart, fast moving and positive sum environment of their lives to transform how healthcare is delivered globally.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We hope that&#39;s you.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;About the Role&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a Senior Manager, Data Platform to lead our UK data engineering organisation and drive the development of a scalable, standardised data foundation across our international markets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you will lead a lean, multidisciplinary technical team spanning Data Engineering, Analytics Engineering, and Machine Learning Engineering, growing the team to&amp;nbsp; 6+ people by the end of 2027. You will be responsible for the technical direction, operational resilience, and delivery effectiveness of the platform, ensuring that engineering resources are sharply directed toward the highest-value commercial, product, and technical priorities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will partner closely with Product, Commercial, Clinical, and Operations leaders in the UK, as well as Data and Technology leadership in Australia, to align regional architecture with our broader international data strategy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a critical transformation phase: over the next year, your team will enable the launch of three to five new markets and execute the migration of two international businesses onto our shared data infrastructure, including complex transitions from Databricks and Redshift to Google Cloud Platform (GCP).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a senior leadership role requiring a balance of strong architectural judgement, technical credibility, and the ability to operate fluidly across strategic planning, people leadership, and hands-on platform transformation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead, mentor, and develop a multidisciplinary UK data platform team across Data Engineering, Analytics Engineering, and Data Science/MLE.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define the roadmap, technical priorities, and operating model for the data platform, ensuring engineering investments are effectively aligned to key business initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee and execute the migration of international data ecosystems onto a shared GCP infrastructure (specifically driving the transition from Databricks and Redshift).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate globally with Data and Technology leadership to architect a consistent, highly scalable, and internationally aligned data infrastructure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with UK Product, Commercial, Analytics, and Operations leaders to shape and deliver a resilient international data roadmap.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive the core data platform execution and scaling required to seamlessly support the launch of new markets and brands.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide authoritative technical leadership and sound architectural judgement across data pipelines, ML infrastructure, and overall cloud platform decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cultivate a high-performing, accountable engineering environment with strong technical standards, clear ownership, and sustainable software delivery practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About You&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of technical experience encompassing data engineering, platform engineering, machine learning operations, or core data science.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of management experience, successfully leading and developing multidisciplinary technical teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience designing, building, and operating a modern, scalable cloud data platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong foundation in data or platform engineering, with the hands-on credibility to guide architecture, code standards, and infrastructure decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional product judgement with the ability to connect underlying technical investments directly to tangible business outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to prioritise ruthlessly, manage competing operational demands, and create clarity in dynamic or ambiguous environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong influencing and translation skills, capable of bridging the gap between deep technical engineering teams and senior business stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ideally, you bring a track record of leading complex platform migrations (especially into GCP environments), supporting international market expansions, or driving large-scale technology transformations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;At Eucalyptus, we value individuals from all backgrounds, experiences, and perspectives, and we embrace the unique qualities each person brings. When you apply, please let us know of any reasonable adjustments you may need during the interview process. We use AI-assisted tools across our business to help our teams work more efficiently, including within our recruitment process. These tools support our team — all hiring decisions are made by real people, and every application is reviewed by a member of our recruitment team.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Anthropic&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Anthropic’s mission is to create reliable, interpretable, and steerable AI systems. We want AI to be safe and beneficial for our users and for society as a whole. Our team is a quickly growing group of committed researchers, engineers, policy experts, and business leaders working together to build beneficial AI systems.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;About the role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Every change to Anthropic&#39;s software has to reach production somehow: new code, runtime configuration, feature flags, infrastructure changes. Our team builds the systems those changes travel through. Our mission is to give every team at Anthropic a fast, safe, and predictable path from change to production.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll join the team within Anthropic&#39;s Infrastructure organization that owns pipelines, staged rollouts, health-gated promotion, and rollback, along with runtime configuration, feature flags, and the systems that deliver code and artifacts to machines across a very large fleet. You&#39;ll own a meaningful part of this end to end, from design through operating it in production.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you want your work to shape how fast and how safely Anthropic ships, this could be a great fit.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Key responsibilities&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set technical direction for major parts of the deployment platform and own them end to end: design, implementation, operations, and on-call&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build rollout safety into the platform, including progressive delivery, health-gated promotion, automatic pause and rollback, and deploy controls that teams manage themselves&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design APIs and abstractions that work equally well for engineers and for AI agents&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extend the platform to new workload types and runtimes, from Kubernetes to serverless and edge platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and operate runtime configuration and feature flag systems with validation, gradual rollout, and fast rollback&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build infrastructure-as-code workflows that many teams rely on for safe, routine changes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Scale artifact distribution so code and configuration reach machines quickly and efficiently&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Security so that the path to production is secure by default, with verifiable builds, least-privilege access, and auditable changes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work directly with teams across Anthropic to understand their deployment needs and bring their workloads onto the platform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take part in on-call and incident response, and turn what you learn into guardrails so the same problem can&#39;t recur&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Minimum qualifications&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in at least one backend or systems programming language, such as Rust, Go, C++, or Java&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading the design, building, and operation of distributed systems or infrastructure in production, including technical direction across teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with cloud infrastructure and containerized workloads, such as Kubernetes on AWS or GCP&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong written and verbal communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Preferred qualifications&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building deployment, release, or change management systems at large scale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with production on-call and incident response&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Rust in production&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with progressive delivery and GitOps tooling, such as Argo CD or Argo Rollouts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep knowledge of Kubernetes, including controllers and operators&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Terraform or other infrastructure-as-code systems at scale, including state management and locking&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building feature flag, experimentation, or dynamic configuration systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with artifact or package distribution, such as OCI registries, Nix, or content-addressed storage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with software supply chain security, such as signed build provenance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building high-throughput workflow engines or control planes backed by relational databases&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building internal developer platforms and driving adoption across many teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience using AI agents in your own engineering work, or building systems that agents operate&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Representative projects&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build operator controls for progressive rollouts, including pause and resume that preserve rollout state&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design a deployment engine built on fine-grained targets and their dependencies, so each change rolls out exactly where it needs to&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build cluster-health-aware rollouts that steer around unhealthy clusters&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Add a new workload type to the platform, including its rollout, verification, and rollback behavior&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design a deployment control plane that handles sharp bursts of agent-driven traffic&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design a distribution system that delivers configuration and artifacts to every machine in the fleet as demand grows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;The annual compensation range for this role is listed below.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For sales roles, the range provided is the role’s On Target Earnings (&quot;OTE&quot;) range, meaning that the range includes both the sales commissions/sales bonuses target and annual base salary for the role.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Annual Salary:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;£325,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;£390,000 GBP&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Logistics&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum education: &lt;/strong&gt;Bachelor’s degree or an equivalent combination of education, training, and/or experience&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required field of study:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;A field relevant to the role as demonstrated through coursework, training, or professional experience&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum years of experience: &lt;/strong&gt;Years of experience required will correlate with the internal job level requirements for the position&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location-based hybrid policy:&lt;/strong&gt; Currently, we expect all staff to be in one of our offices at least 25% of the time. However, some roles may require more time in our offices.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Visa sponsorship:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;We do sponsor visas! However, we aren&#39;t able to successfully sponsor visas for every role and every candidate. But if we make you an offer, we will make every reasonable effort to get you a visa, and we retain an immigration lawyer to help with this.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;For roles performing work in California: &lt;/strong&gt;We will consider for employment all qualified applicants, including those with arrest or conviction records or criminal histories, in a manner consistent with the requirements of applicable state and local laws, including the San Francisco Fair Chance Ordinance, the City of Los Angeles’ Fair Chance Initiative for Hiring Ordinance, the Los Angeles County Fair Chance Ordinance for Employers, and the California Fair Chance Act.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We encourage you to apply even if you do not believe you meet every single qualification.&lt;/strong&gt; Not all strong candidates will meet every single qualification as listed.&amp;nbsp; Research shows that people who identify as being from underrepresented groups are more prone to experiencing imposter syndrome and doubting the strength of their candidacy, so we urge you not to exclude yourself prematurely and to submit an application if you&#39;re interested in this work. We think AI systems like the ones we&#39;re building have enormous social and ethical implications. We think this makes representation even more important, and we strive to include a range of diverse perspectives on our team.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Your safety matters to us.&lt;/strong&gt; To protect yourself from potential scams, remember that Anthropic recruiters only contact you ----- addresses. In some cases, we may partner with vetted recruiting agencies who will identify themselves as working on behalf of Anthropic. Be cautious of emails from other domains. Legitimate Anthropic recruiters will never ask for money, fees, or banking information before your first day. If you&#39;re ever unsure about a communication, don&#39;t click any links—visit&amp;nbsp;&lt;u data-stringify-type=&quot;underline&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link c-link--underline&quot; href=&quot;http://anthropic.com/careers&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;http://anthropic.com/careers&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot; data-remove-tab-index=&quot;true&quot;&gt;anthropic.com/careers&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&amp;nbsp;directly for confirmed position openings.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How we&#39;re different&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe that the highest-impact AI research will be big science. At Anthropic we work as a single cohesive team on just a few large-scale research efforts. And we value impact — advancing our long-term goals of steerable, trustworthy AI — rather than work on smaller and more specific puzzles. We view AI research as an empirical science, which has as much in common with physics and biology as with traditional efforts in computer science. We&#39;re an extremely collaborative group, and we host frequent research discussions to ensure that we are pursuing the highest-impact work at any given time. As such, we greatly value communication skills.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The easiest way to understand our research directions is to read our recent research. This research continues many of the directions our team worked on prior to Anthropic, including: GPT-3, Circuit-Based Interpretability, Multimodal Neurons, Scaling Laws, AI &amp;amp; Compute, Concrete Problems in AI Safety, and Learning from Human Preferences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Come work with us!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Anthropic is a public benefit corporation headquartered in San Francisco. We offer competitive compensation and benefits, optional equity donation matching, generous vacation and parental leave, flexible working hours, and a lovely office space in which to collaborate with colleagues. &lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Guidance on Candidates&#39; AI Usage:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Learn about&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://www.anthropic.com/candidate-ai-guidance&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://www.anthropic.com/candidate-ai-guidance&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;our policy&lt;/a&gt; for using AI in our application process.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Celonis is the trusted platform to industrialize Enterprise AI. At our core is the Celonis Context Model — which combines process data, business knowledge, and intelligence into a living digital twin of the enterprise that AI can actually understand, turning AI&#39;s operational blind spots into operational clarity. World&#39;s leading companies trust Celonis and its global ecosystem of partners to make their AI agents, people, systems, and processes work together, achieving transformational outcomes. We believe there&#39;s a massive opportunity to unlock global productivity and sustainability by giving AI the context to understand how every business process really works. Join our mission to make processes work for people, companies, and the planet.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a curious, smart, and “learn it all” Architect with proven experience and a passion for designing transformative solution architectures for our prospects and customers. This high-impact role demands a unique blend of deep technical expertise and executive presence, requiring you to confidently present to &lt;strong&gt;C-level executives&lt;/strong&gt; and translate their strategic goals into actionable technical plans. You will work with technical teams at our prospects and customers to design architectures that drive &lt;strong&gt;enterprise modernization&lt;/strong&gt;, leveraging techniques like &lt;strong&gt;capability mapping&lt;/strong&gt; and exploring innovative solutions with &lt;strong&gt;Agentic AI&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your primary goal is to support our growing sales team in achieving revenue goals by unlocking technical blockers and partnering closely with our Sales, Value Engineering, Product Management, Data Ops, and Information Security teams. You will be responsible for supporting engagements with new prospects as well as existing customers that look to expand their footprint. Measures of success include new customer acquisition rates, retention, up-selling, and contribution to overall sales team and business success.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The work you’ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and define the overall architecture, data, and cloud strategy for our largest client accounts, leveraging expertise like &lt;strong&gt;enterprise modernization&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;capability mapping&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confidently engage with and present to customer &lt;strong&gt;C-level executives&lt;/strong&gt;, aligning their strategic objectives with the Celonis technical strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive innovation by identifying and architecting solutions that leverage emergent technologies, including &lt;strong&gt;Agentic AI&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be the bridge between our product &amp;amp; engineering teams within Celonis and the client&#39;s teams to provide the best technical services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assess the IT landscape maturity of our customer installed base for the region.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in pre-Sales and post-Sales phases by engaging with customer Architecture and security teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coach and guide Celonis consulting teams and ecosystem partners on technical implementation issues such as architecture, integration, performance, and scalability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop re-usable assets for the consulting teams on projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop customer-facing position papers, assets, and thought leadership presentations on architecture and innovation with Celonis.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create technical designs and presentations for internal and client stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The qualifications you need:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10 to 15 years of relevant experience (e.g., Software vendor Architect, CTO at a top consulting firm, or Enterprise Architect at a customer).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to &lt;strong&gt;think strategically&lt;/strong&gt;, connecting technical solutions to business value and customer objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and verbal communication skills, with a proven track record of &lt;strong&gt;presenting complex technical concepts&lt;/strong&gt; and strategic visions to &lt;strong&gt;C-level executives&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience in &lt;strong&gt;Capability Mapping&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;Enterprise Modernization&lt;/strong&gt;, and a strong understanding of &lt;strong&gt;Agentic AI&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of cloud-native architectures, SaaS solutions, ERP (particularly &lt;strong&gt;SAP S/4HANA or ECC), &lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Salesforce, Dynamics CRM or ServiceNow), cybersecurity posture fundamentals, API ecosystems, along with legacy on-premise enterprise architectures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong background in Data Architecture, Integrations patterns, and a development background in data-related languages (SQL, Python, etc.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong technical background with a focus on system integrations, data operations, and automation capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to comfortably switch from explaining an architecture diagram to an environment where you have coded or assembled a demo of that architecture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;MSc degree in Computer Science or an equivalent in an Information Technology-related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in&amp;nbsp;English is required; an additional language such as Spanish, German, French or Italian is a strong advantage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Additional qualifications preferred:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Celonis Certifications and Experience with OCPM and Case Centric Data Pipelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;AWS/Azure/GCP Certifications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;ESB / ETL Certifications (Mulesoft, Oracle, SAP, Talend, Informatica).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;TOGAF/Zachmann Certification.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in at least two domains among: Finance, Manufacturing, Supply Chain, Customer/Consumer Management (Service, Order Management, Sales), HR, Procurement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in at least two industries among: Consumer Goods, Banking, Pharma, Aerospace, Telco, Transport.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Celonis can offer you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;p-rich_text_list p-rich_text_list__bullet p-rich_text_list--nested&quot; data-stringify-type=&quot;unordered-list&quot; data-list-tree=&quot;true&quot; data-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Pioneer Innovation:&lt;/span&gt; Work with the global leader in Process Mining and the Process Intelligence Graph to shape the future of AI-driven business operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Ownership from Day 1:&lt;/span&gt; Every full-time &quot;Celonaut&quot; is an owner, receiving Restricted Stock Units (RSUs) and merit-based refresh grants.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Unrivaled Family Support:&lt;/span&gt; Benefit from our inclusive parental leave policy—24 weeks of fully paid leave for primary carers and 12 weeks for supporting carers, available from your first day of employment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Work-Life Integration:&lt;/span&gt; Enjoy Unlimited PTO (in applicable regions) and generous PTO globally, as well as a flexible hybrid work model that balances remote focus with vibrant office collaboration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Continuous Growth:&lt;/span&gt; Elevate your skills through our 70-20-10 learning framework, mentorship programs, and access to a dedicated learning platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Holistic Well-being:&lt;/span&gt; Prioritize your health with subsidized Wellhub memberships, mental health counseling, and dedicated &quot;Wellness Weeks&quot; that prioritize work/life balance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Drive Sustainability:&lt;/span&gt; Participate in annual Impact Days, where you receive paid time off to volunteer for community and environmental causes with your local office, or virtually.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Global Inclusion &amp;amp; Belonging:&lt;/span&gt; Find community through our Inclusion Think Tank and participate in our annual Inclusion Days, ensuring every voice is heard and valued.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Value-Driven Impact:&lt;/span&gt; Join a mission-led organization where our core values—Live for Customer Value, The Best Team Wins, We Own It, and Earth Is Our Future—drive every decision.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Us:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1264&quot;&gt;Celonis is the trusted platform to industrialize Enterprise AI, empowering organizations to analyze, design, and operate AI-driven processes. The Celonis Platform is powered by the Celonis Context Model, which combines process data, business knowledge, and intelligence to create a living digital twin of the enterprise that AI can understand — turning AI’s operational blind spots into operational clarity. Industry-leading companies around the world trust Celonis and its global ecosystem of partners to make their AI agents, people, systems, and processes work together, achieving transformational outcomes. Celonis is headquartered in Munich, Germany, and New York City, USA, with more than 20 offices worldwide.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1982&quot;&gt;Get familiar with the Celonis Process Intelligence Platform by watching this &lt;a class=&quot;_ymio1r31 _ypr0glyw _zcxs1o36 _mizu194a _1ah3dkaa _ra3xnqa1 _128mdkaa _1cvmnqa1 _4davt94y _4bfu18uv _1hms8stv _ajmmnqa1 _vchhusvi _kqswh2mm _ect4ttxp _2rkolb4i _syaz13af _1a3b18uv _4fpr8stv _5goinqa1 _f8pj13af _9oik18uv _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _30l313af _1nrm18uv _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _9h8h12zz _10531ra0 _1ien1ra0 _n0fx1ra0 _1vhv17z1&quot; href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=YR5oRJGhJYg&amp;amp;list=PLuVor-ZUD4pnM6G33C5D0tjXUvlTPYBRe&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-is-router-link=&quot;false&quot; data-testid=&quot;link-with-safety&quot;&gt;video&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Celonis Inclusion Statement:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Celonis, we believe our people make us who we are and that “The Best Team Wins”. We know that the best teams are made up of people who bring different perspectives to the table. And when everyone feels included, able to speak up and knows their voice is heard - that&#39;s when creativity and innovation happen.&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Privacy:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Any information you submit to Celonis as part of your application will be processed in accordance with Celonis’ &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.celonis.com/careers/candidate-notices&quot;&gt;Accessibility and Candidate Notices&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By submitting this application, you confirm that you agree to the storing and processing of your personal data by Celonis as described in our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.celonis.com/careers/privacy-notice/&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice for the Application and Hiring Process&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Use of Artificial Intelligence Tools&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We rely on an artificial intelligence tool to match the information from your resume to the relevant Celonis job descriptions. This processing is limited to the information provided in your resume or in your candidate profile. The tool produces a match score per candidate for a role, suggests preliminary ranking, and provides recommendations.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;The tool is only used for support in parts of the job application process, including to facilitate the identification of the relevant Celonis Jobs for candidates and recruiters. All final decisions are made by hiring managers and the Celonis talent acquisition team. Hiring managers and HR specialists use this tool responsibly, are aware of the risk of potential bias, and are equipped to mitigate it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please be aware of common job offer scams, impersonators and frauds. Learn more &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.celonis.com/careers/fraud-alert/&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.ch/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Switzerland</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Firmus Technologies&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Firmus Technologies is a global leader pioneering the development and operation of efficient AI infrastructure across Asia Pacific.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Founded in Australia in 2019, our mission is to create the most efficient AI infrastructure by combining cutting-edge technology with a steadfast commitment to sustainability.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Firmus, we are unique in our approach. We design, build, and operate a new class of digital infrastructure – the AI Factory. Through our model-to-grid technology approach, we have pushed the boundaries of multi-generational liquid cooling systems, energy management, AI software orchestration, and construction. For our customers&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Firmus AI Cloud&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our large-scale GPU cloud platform, Firmus AI Cloud, is purpose-built to deliver energy-efficient AI compute at scale to customers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;It empowers developers, enterprises, educational institutions, and government users to train and deploy AI models with unmatched efficiency and cost savings. With an ever-growing suite of services and applications, we are committed to delivering a cloud experience that is market-leading, proprietary, and built to scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Summary&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;As Principal Network Architect, Backbone Connectivity at Firmus, you will lead the architecture and technical assurance of the backbone connectivity platform that underpins the Firmus AI Factory ecosystem and Firmus AI Cloud. The role directly reports to the Network Engineering team as a principal technical lead and acts as a dedicated support of the Head of Connectivity as the primary technical authority for backbone architecture. You will translate Firmus’s connectivity strategy into a scalable, resilient and vendor-neutral architecture, define the standards and design patterns that guide implementation, and ensure the backbone network positions Firmus as a leader in AI-ready connectivity, with focus on building and evolving Firmus’s national and international backbone across terrestrial and subsea networks, optical transport, IP backbone, data-centre interconnection and partner connectivity.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:120}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;The role directly reports to the Network Engineering team as a principal technical lead and acts as a dedicated support the Head of Connectivity as the primary technical authority for backbone architecture. You will translate Firmus’s connectivity strategy into a scalable, resilient and vendor-neutral architecture, define the standards and design patterns that guide implementation, and ensure the backbone network positions Firmus as a leader in AI-ready connectivity.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:120}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;This role is responsible for the technical integrity of the backbone architecture across the full lifecycle, from concept and design assurance through delivery readiness, operational resilience and continuous improvement. You will work across carriers, subsea operators, terrestrial fibre providers, data-centre partners and internal engineering teams to ensure Firmus’s network connectivity is high-performance, secure, operationally robust and ready to scale with the company’s AI infrastructure growth.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:120}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;As Principal Network Architect, Backbone Connectivity, you will own the technical architecture of Firmus&#39;s backbone network and act as the principal technical adviser to the Head of Connectivity, while operating as a senior technical lead within the Network Engineering team. You will convert the Firmus Connectivity Strategy into an integrated, executable backbone architecture spanning subsea and terrestrial fibre, optical transport (DWDM/OTN), IP/MPLS and segment routing, data-centre interconnection and partner connectivity. You will define the reference architecture, standards and reusable design patterns that guide engineers and partners, ensuring every AI Factory and Firmus AI Cloud service attaches through resilient, diverse and scalable backbone nodes free of unmanaged common-mode failure.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:120}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Working across carriers, subsea operators, terrestrial fibre providers and data-centre partners, you will set minimum resilience profiles, validate physical-route and shared-risk-link-group diversity, and provide independent technical assurance that designs can be delivered, operated and scaled safely across their full lifecycle. You will act as technical design authority in vendor and technology selection for backbone and subsea services, lead complex backbone changes and cutovers, mentor the engineering team, and benchmark Firmus&#39;s designs against leading global operators and hyperscalers — keeping Firmus at the forefront of AI-ready network connectivity.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:120}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;No Spacing&quot;&gt;What &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;No Spacing&quot;&gt;you’ll&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;No Spacing&quot;&gt; bring&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;You are, first and foremost, an accomplished network architect for large-scale, mission-critical connectivity infrastructure. You bring deep expertise in national and international backbone design across terrestrial long-haul fibre and subsea systems, including landing-station connectivity, cable-landing diversity, and terrestrial route and duct engineering. You are fluent in optical transport (DWDM/OTN, coherent and client-side optics, ROADM and amplification/regeneration planning) and in IP backbone design, including IP/MPLS, segment routing, EVPN, traffic engineering, peering, transit and internet exchange, and high-capacity data-centre and customer interconnection. You understand how to design resilient, diverse networks free of unmanaged common-mode failure, using SRLG analysis, engineered failure-state capacity and physical-route evidence to prove your claims rather than assert them.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:120}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Across the delivery lifecycle, you are equally at home leading architecture and design reviews, carrier and technology-vendor governance, technical evaluation of backbone and subsea services, change control, cutover planning, and operational-readiness and handover to network operations. You have authored or materially shaped reference architectures, design standards, reusable patterns and architecture decision records at a hyperscale operator, carrier, or equivalent, and you know how to keep an architecture modular and vendor-neutral so the business can flex across managed services, wavelengths, dark fibre and subsea assets as demand and economics change. You are comfortable engaging carriers, subsea consortia, internet exchanges and major equipment vendors, and you can drive value engineering and sustainability outcomes without compromising resilience or performance.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:120}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Above all, you have the temperament of a senior technical leader operating across geographies: strong systems thinking, calm judgement under delivery and incident pressure, the confidence to challenge design and vendor assumptions constructively, and the communication skill to carry a room of network engineers, a customer technical review, and an executive readout with equal clarity. You bring commercial awareness, comfort operating across cultures and time zones, and a genuine passion for building AI-ready network connectivity that performs reliably from day one and positions Firmus as a leader in the field.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:120}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills &amp;amp; Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;The ideal candidate will bring a strong technical foundation in network and connectivity engineering, ideally with a Bachelor&#39;s or Master&#39;s degree in Electrical/Electronic Engineering, Telecommunications, Computer Science or a related discipline, together with more than 12 years of progressive experience designing and operating large-scale backbone networks across carrier, hyperscale, cloud or specialist AI infrastructure environments. They will have deep, hands-on expertise as a principal-level network architect or distinguished engineer on national and international backbone programmes, and a proven track record owning reference architectures, design standards and technical assurance across a portfolio of concurrent connectivity initiatives.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:120}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;This experience should include end-to-end design and delivery across terrestrial long-haul fibre and subsea cable systems — including landing-station connectivity, route and duct diversity, and SRLG-based resilience modelling — alongside deep expertise in optical transport (DWDM/OTN, coherent optics, 100G/400G/800G) and IP backbone design (IP/MPLS, segment routing, EVPN, traffic engineering, peering, transit and internet exchange). They will have led technical evaluations of carriers, subsea operators and equipment vendors, defined the technical sections of RFPs and evaluation criteria, and worked effectively across the design-to-operate interface with Network Engineering, Data Centre and Operations teams.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:120}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Experience authoring or contributing materially to global backbone reference architecture, minimum standards or interconnection strategy at a hyperscale, carrier or AI infrastructure operator is a strong differentiator, as is experience delivering into APAC markets — particularly Indonesia, Australia and Singapore — under diverse regulatory, licensing and provider conditions. Above all, the successful candidate will combine hands-on architectural depth with the influence and communication skills to lead as a senior technical authority&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location &amp;amp; Reporting&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;This role is based in Sydney, Australia.&lt;/li&gt;
